# This placeholder keeps the music/ folder in version control.
#
# AUDIO POLICY (version 1.2): the audio files that belong here
# (currently music/menu_theme.mp3) are NOT stored in git. Place them
# on disk manually from your external audio storage before compiling
# a release. The build embeds this whole folder via `#pragma asset
# "music"`, so an empty folder compiles cleanly and the game simply
# runs without menu music until the file is provided.
